> > >
> > > A binary character model is easy(ish) to set up in BioGeoBEARS, I think the code for this is online somewhere on PhyloWiki.  Basically it's:
> > >
> > > - the BAYAREALIKE model
> > > - with 1 area max
> > > - null range off
> > > - d and e fixed to 0
